Place ML model files here:

1. ggml-base.en.bin (~150MB) - Whisper speech-to-text model
   Download: https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp/tree/main

2. fer_expression.onnx - Facial expression recognition (ViT-base, 224x224 RGB, 7 classes)
   Download: https://huggingface.co/trpakov/vit-face-expression/tree/main/onnx
   Rename the downloaded file to fer_expression.onnx

3. hand_landmark.onnx - Hand landmark detection (21 keypoints per hand)
   Download: https://huggingface.co/opencv/handpose_estimation_mediapipe
   Rename the downloaded ONNX file to hand_landmark.onnx

4. palm_detection.onnx - Palm detection (required before hand landmark)
   Download: https://huggingface.co/opencv/palm_detection_mediapipe
   Rename the downloaded ONNX file to palm_detection.onnx
